@startuml
title exact-orb — позитивный сценарий: построение космограммы (MVP)

' Первое построение базовой карты при неизвестном времени рождения:
' дата и place_id известны, место разрешается однозначно,
' cache miss, local engine, Луна не меняет знак в течение суток.

autonumber
hide footbox

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

    ParticipantBorderColor #64748B
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

    ActorBorderColor #64748B
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE

    GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
    GroupHeaderFontColor #1E293B

    DividerBorderColor #94A3B8
    DividerFontColor #1E293B

    NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
    NoteFontColor #334155
}

actor "Пользователь" as User


box "1. CLIENT" #DBEAFE
    boundary "Frontend" as Frontend
end box


box "2. API / TRANSPORT" #EDE9FE
    boundary "FastAPI" as API

    control "Session Middleware" as Session

    control "RateLimiter" as RateLimiter
end box


box "3. APPLICATION" #FFEDD5
    control "Orchestrator" as Orch

    control "BuildNatalHandler" as Handler

    control "ProfileService" as Profile
end box


box "4. SESSION STATE" #D1FAE5
    control "ContextService" as Context

    database "Session Store" as SessionStore
end box


box "5. BIRTH DATA RESOLUTION" #D9F9FF
    control "BirthDataResolver" as BirthResolver

    control "PlaceResolverPort" as PlacePort

    control "Place Adapter" as PlaceAdapter

    control "Historical TZ Resolver" as TZResolver
end box


box "6. CHART ARTIFACTS" #E8F5E9
    control "ChartArtifactResolver" as ArtifactResolver

    control "CalculationKeyFactory" as KeyFactory

    database "Calculation Cache" as CalcCache
end box


box "7. CALCULATION ENGINE" #FFFFF0
    control "CalculationEnginePort" as EnginePort

    control "LocalEngineAdapter" as LocalEngine

    control "EngineService" as Engine

    entity "Swiss Ephemeris" as Swiss
end box


== Ввод и транспортные проверки ==

User -> Frontend : Вводит дату и место рождения\nи отмечает «время неизвестно»

Frontend -> API : POST /charts/natal\nBirthInput(date, time_status = unknown, place_id)


note over Frontend, BirthResolver
Frontend передаёт дату, признак
неизвестного времени и canonical place_id.

Место остаётся жёстким слотом.
Координаты, tz_id и reference UTC datetime
определяются на backend.
end note


API -> Session : resolve_or_create(HttpOnly cookie)

Session --> API : session_id


API -> RateLimiter : check(IP, session_id, endpoint)

RateLimiter --> API : RequestPermit


API -> Orch : BuildNatalCommand\n(session_id, BirthInput)


== Загрузка сессии ==

Orch -> Context : load(session_id)

Context -> SessionStore : get(session_id)

SessionStore --> Context : SessionContext\n(profile_version = 0)

Context --> Orch : SessionContext


Orch -> Handler : handle(command, SessionContext)

activate Handler


== Разрешение места и опорного момента ==

Handler -> BirthResolver : resolve(BirthInput)

activate BirthResolver


BirthResolver -> PlacePort : resolve(place_id)

PlacePort -> PlaceAdapter : lookup(place_id)

PlaceAdapter --> PlacePort : canonical place\n(latitude, longitude, tz_id)

PlacePort --> BirthResolver : PlaceResolution


BirthResolver -> BirthResolver : choose reference local time = 12:00\npositions only; time_assumed = true


BirthResolver -> TZResolver : resolve(date @ 12:00, tz_id)

TZResolver --> BirthResolver : utc_offset + reference_utc_datetime


BirthResolver --> Handler : ResolvedBirthData\n(local_date, latitude, longitude, tz_id,\nreference_local_time = 12:00,\nreference_utc_datetime,\ntime_known = false, time_assumed = true)

deactivate BirthResolver


Handler -> Handler : create base Cosmogram ChartSpec\nchart_kind = cosmogram\ninclude = {positions, aspects, configurations}


note right of Handler
Полдень является только опорным
моментом расчёта долгот.

Он не превращается в «примерное»
время рождения и не разрешает
расчёт домов или асцендента.
end note


== Получение или расчёт ChartArtifact ==

Handler -> ArtifactResolver : ensure_natal(\nbirth_resolved, Cosmogram ChartSpec)

activate ArtifactResolver


ArtifactResolver -> KeyFactory : build(ResolvedBirthData,\nCosmogram ChartSpec, CalculationVersion)


note right of KeyFactory
CalculationVersion включает:

• engine version;
• swisseph version;
• fingerprint ephe/*.se1.
end note


KeyFactory --> ArtifactResolver : calculation_key


ArtifactResolver -> CalcCache : get(calculation_key)

CalcCache --> ArtifactResolver : cache miss


ArtifactResolver -> EnginePort : calculate_natal(CalculationRequest)

EnginePort -> LocalEngine : execute(request)

LocalEngine -> Engine : calculate_natal(\ninclude = {positions, aspects, configurations})

activate Engine


Engine -> Swiss : planetary positions\nat reference UTC datetime

Swiss --> Engine : ephemeris positions


Engine -> Swiss : Moon longitude at boundaries\nof the local birth date

Swiss --> Engine : Moon day-range positions


Engine -> Engine : verify Moon sign is stable\ncalculate aspects and configurations


Engine --> LocalEngine : ChartArtifact\nchart_kind = cosmogram\nbodies, aspects, configurations\ncusps = None, angles = None\nhouse_rulers = None, strength = None\nwarnings = [time_unknown]

deactivate Engine


LocalEngine --> EnginePort : ChartArtifact

EnginePort --> ArtifactResolver : ChartArtifact


ArtifactResolver -> CalcCache : put(calculation_key, ChartArtifact)

ArtifactResolver --> Handler : ChartArtifact

deactivate ArtifactResolver


note over ArtifactResolver, CalcCache
Calculation Cache удаляемый.

При eviction космограмма полностью
воспроизводится из birth_resolved,
Cosmogram ChartSpec и CalculationVersion.
end note


== Атомарное обновление SessionProfile ==

Handler -> Profile : commit_base_chart(\nexpected_version = 0,\nbirth_input, birth_resolved,\nCosmogram ChartSpec)


Profile --> Handler : SessionProfileDelta\nprofile_version = 1\nbase_chart = {version: 1, cosmogram spec}\nderived_chart = None\nactive_view = base


note over Handler, Profile
SessionProfile изменяется только после
успешного получения ChartArtifact.

В сессии сохраняются и исходный ввод
«время неизвестно», и разрешённый
опорный момент для воспроизводимости.
end note


Handler --> Orch : BuildResult(ChartArtifact)\n+ ContextDelta

deactivate Handler


Orch -> Context : save(session_id, ContextDelta,\nexpected_version = 0)

Context -> SessionStore : compare-and-set SessionProfile

SessionStore --> Context : saved\nprofile_version = 1

Context --> Orch : save confirmed


== Ответ клиенту ==

Orch --> API : BuildNatalResponse\nchart_kind = cosmogram\nChart DTO + warnings\nactive_view = base

API --> Frontend : 200 JSON


Frontend -> Frontend : render cosmogram SVG\nplanets + aspects; no houses

Frontend --> User : Показывает космограмму\nс предупреждением о неизвестном времени


note over Orch, Engine
LLM в построении космограммы
не участвует.

Успешный результат явно несёт
chart_kind = cosmogram и warning
об неизвестном времени; отсутствие домов
не используется для угадывания вида карты.
end note

@enduml
